{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026sP8qSqPpK21795038694.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國俘虜委內瑞拉總統馬杜羅逾十個月，美國防長赫格塞思訪問委內瑞拉，雙方簽署恢復軍事技術合作協議。</p><p></p><p>美國防長赫格塞思周三訪問加拉加斯，會晤委內瑞拉臨時總統羅德里格斯，雙方簽署軍事技術合作協議，內容涉及美方更新作戰裝備、訓練委軍部隊等。羅德里格斯認為有助兩國應對共同威脅。赫格塞思就期待兩國合力打擊毒販及恐怖分子。</p><p></p><p>美軍今年初強行將馬杜羅夫婦帶去美國，之後雙方同意恢復外交關係。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T01:24:00.348635+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":187,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T00:35:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T14:32:02.033243+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T01:17:23.795157+00:00","content_hash":"c344c3797327ce9be4240f8114d1c046a4e2ed896c0f90691827ff790d9772da","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T01:24:00.348635+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}